{"lines":[{"y":0.0016417403082793491,"x":-0.0011900847949699055,"w":0.31396573384602861,"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.045298951635670215,"c":1},{"h":0.036535901094959966,"w":0.50375554402669265,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.092064391279772714,"y":0.088586636231841931,"c":1},{"x":0.17426485125145008,"y":0.15444796079278955,"w":0.2901098887125651,"h":0.018220181310423023,"t":"Additional sample Writing answers","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.15195072174072263,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"in Resource Bank","y":0.17433628343331464,"x":0.17453798603616491},{"w":0.3593429056803385,"x":0.092402469048239719,"y":0.22383720960883902,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 1","h":0.021885504483473373,"c":1},{"w":0.69609858194986984,"h":0.016050113126591659,"c":1,"y":0.25575221233442091,"x":0.092402454291500652,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score."},{"c":1,"y":0.27984098711366934,"x":0.090294325815611393,"t":"The line graph highlights data about how many people participated in 5 various activities at one","w":0.79888834635416672,"h":0.020842359199636507},{"c":1,"t":"social club in Melbourne, Australia for the first two decades of XXI century.","x":0.090349076961954794,"y":0.30232558141804367,"w":0.63449691772460937,"h":0.017441860412777732},{"t":"Overall, over the years more participants got involved in activities on Table tennis and Musical","x":0.09240247001027474,"y":0.32848837258752495,"h":0.01900425238595238,"c":1,"w":0.79055440266927079},{"y":0.34883720979665289,"h":0.019009398288783008,"c":1,"t":"plays, while Amateur dramatics lost its interest for public. Being flactuated, two types of activities,","x":0.092402470800766426,"w":0.8151950581868489},{"y":0.36740576320230711,"h":0.02197429465684908,"t":"which are Film club and Martial arts levelled off. Another striking point is that over a twenty - year","c":1,"w":0.8359089660644532,"x":0.092295337228333857},{"w":0.76591374715169258,"h":0.020494615222852119,"c":1,"y":0.38953488355626453,"t":"period between 2000 and 2020, the Film club kept its position as the most popular activity.","x":0.092402469084449212},{"h":0.022269978706112359,"x":0.092312605908204448,"t":"Looking at the details of Table tennis, in 2000, there were about 15 participants in club for it.","w":0.78045583089192694,"y":0.41505729994242491,"c":1},{"t":"In the next 10 years, it attracted 5 more members, before dramatic surge from 20 to below 60","w":0.79260777791341153,"x":0.090349088351726156,"y":0.43746312733837489,"h":0.01893222099911851,"c":1},{"x":0.092402476731055574,"y":0.45781710932467035,"h":0.018927076221567418,"t":"participants. In 2005, the activity on Musical performances introduced and over the following 15","w":0.80082132975260412,"c":1},{"y":0.47817109131086177,"t":"years, it saw a steady increase on the number of participants by about 20 in the last year.","c":1,"h":0.018921931444016216,"x":0.09034906805620864,"w":0.75359344482421875},{"t":"Regarding next two activities, Film club and Martial arts, the saw fluactions, but without any","x":0.092402475658462421,"w":0.76796712239583342,"h":0.018943369142425448,"c":1,"y":0.50436046561052461},{"c":1,"h":0.018948513919976651,"x":0.0903490640158814,"y":0.52470930281929884,"t":"changes in the overall position. Film club started the process with about 60 members and finished","w":0.82546203613281255},{"t":"it just below 70, while the participants of Martial arts kept their numbers at around 35.","w":0.73511291503906251,"x":0.090349086608590881,"c":1,"y":0.54505814002676256,"h":0.018953659822807167},{"w":0.79685180664062494,"h":0.020866074463610773,"c":1,"t":"The number of participants of amateurs on draturgy was about 25 and it saw a steady decrease","x":0.09027372149896469,"y":0.5709105603839213},{"y":0.59265182854581577,"w":0.096771831512451181,"x":0.090217780267089556,"c":1,"h":0.018184714190727869,"t":"then by 10."},{"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.092402467591669549,"w":0.31416837056477864,"y":0.62354651183241638,"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221524},{"t":"This good response begins with an introduction, then in the second paragraph","x":0.13963038168552183,"y":0.64534883723302183,"w":0.73716634114583335,"h":0.017483021446385583,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.13757701391115545,"w":0.7761806742350259,"h":0.015988371857499684,"y":0.66279069778961819,"t":"summarises the main trends. The next few paragraphs contain the data and cover"},{"w":0.76591374715169269,"y":0.68023255825464957,"c":1,"t":"each of the participant groups. The information is organised logically and a range","h":0.015988371857499684,"x":0.13757700722259528},{"t":"of linking devices are used [Overall | Another striking point | In the next 10 years].","x":0.13956470451641204,"c":1,"y":0.69753333492593705,"w":0.76605183919270836,"h":0.019168124578695322},{"t":"There is also some flexible reference and substitution [while | which | it | their] with","h":0.019445089604650634,"c":1,"w":0.77226608276367181,"y":0.71362359320353863,"x":0.13952695618078034},{"t":"a few inaccuracies.","w":0.18738843282063802,"x":0.13736563165768559,"y":0.73329726346056545,"h":0.01683687418259705,"c":1},{"x":0.13757700670277132,"t":"Vocabulary is generally good [got involved in | levelled off | dramatic surge], but","c":1,"y":0.76017441872021074,"w":0.74948664347330729,"h":0.015988371857499573},{"h":0.0160235300879914,"c":1,"t":"there are some errors [flactuated \/ fluctuated | amateurs on draturgy \/ amateur","x":0.13757700001407558,"y":0.77758112095470688,"w":0.73921971638997397},{"t":"dramatics]. This response has a variety of grammatical structures and the past","x":0.13757701209475329,"w":0.74332646687825521,"h":0.016061260707258884,"c":1,"y":0.7949852506030316},{"h":0.016224188790560534,"c":1,"t":"simple tense is well controlled. There are sentences with multiple clauses, including","x":0.13757700158293196,"y":0.81386430671705334,"w":0.78850102742513017},{"h":0.016224188790560423,"x":0.13963039505517286,"y":0.83126843656261917,"t":"superlatives [most popular], but also some errors in verb forms [introduced \/ was","w":0.7577001953125001,"c":1},{"t":"introduced], some missing articles [public \/ the public | dramatic surge \/ a dramatic","y":0.84883720932615059,"x":0.13757701390752505,"w":0.7761806742350259,"h":0.017534472035095727,"c":1},{"w":0.73716634114583324,"h":0.014568326606863025,"t":"surge | next two \/ the next two], some errors with prepositions [in club for it \/ in","x":0.13757699361143949,"c":1,"y":0.86773255834648277},{"c":1,"t":"the club | by about 20 \/ to about 20] and inconsistent capitalisation. The candidate","x":0.13757700106130766,"y":0.88517441872025238,"w":0.77207392374674466,"h":0.016005522241283043},{"w":0.71868581136067688,"x":0.13757701206559175,"y":0.90261627918478216,"h":0.015988371857499573,"t":"should demonstrate a greater level of accuracy with grammatical structures.","c":1},{"y":0.91715116281836606,"w":0.036960983276367182,"t":"128","c":1,"x":0.092402465446005305,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"x":0.51176469619230891,"c":1,"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.04166666666666663,"w":0.45882354736328124}],"w":2400,"h":3390}